# Keep planning documents local until the final project documentation is ready.
# These patterns match README files in the root and in every member folder.
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Mm][Ee] from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Mm][Ee]
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Mm][Ee].* from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Mm][Ee].*
# Explains: Keep per-file README explanation notes local until final documentation is requested.
**/[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Mm][Ee]_*
# Explains: Exclude paths matching /Implementation_Plan.md from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
/Implementation_Plan.md
# Explains: Exclude paths matching /LinkWorks_Project_Plan.docx from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
/LinkWorks_Project_Plan.docx

# Flutter / Dart generated files
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/.dart_tool/ from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/.dart_tool/
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/build/ from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/build/
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/.flutter-plugins from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/.flutter-plugins
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/.flutter-plugins-dependencies from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/android/local.properties from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/android/local.properties

# Node and Firebase local artifacts
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/node_modules/ from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/node_modules/
# Explains: Exclude paths matching .firebase/ from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
.firebase/
# Explains: Exclude paths matching *-debug.log from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
*-debug.log
# Explains: Exclude paths matching *-debug.*.log from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
*-debug.*.log

# Local credentials and environment files
# Explains: Exclude paths matching .env from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
.env
# Explains: Exclude paths matching .env.* from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
.env.*
# Explains: Exclude paths matching !.env.example from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
!.env.example
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/*service-account*.json from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/*service-account*.json
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/*serviceAccount*.json from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/*serviceAccount*.json
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/*.jks from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/*.jks
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/*.keystore from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/*.keystore
# Explains: Exclude paths matching **/key.properties from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
**/key.properties

# Local editor state
# Explains: Exclude paths matching .idea/ from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
.idea/
# Explains: Exclude paths matching *.iml from new Git additions; existing tracked files would require separate untracking.
*.iml

# Python development-tool caches are local build artifacts.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
